{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3722867381e1de17","name":"Sector Ranger","source":{"id":"source:reference-3722867381e1de17","title":"Sector Ranger","revision":23070,"timestamp":"2024-09-15T13:31:49Z","sha256":"9863f2722dea61029b159313304540f53243928dc71286a93f2040b8c5e54ddc","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=23070","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Sector%20Ranger&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3722867381e1de17","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sector Rangers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sector_Rangers","referenceId":"reference:82cdaa1d1f56c749"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Established in the early days of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sector Rangers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sector_Rangers","referenceId":"reference:82cdaa1d1f56c749"}," are a law enforcement agency with wide-ranging powers. Sector Rangers are given the power to track and apprehend criminals throughout an entire region of the galaxy, often encompassing hundreds or thousands of planets. Because their powers are involved in law enforcement, and not military or political, Sector Rangers must walk a delicate line of jurisdictions, local laws, and customs.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Sector Rangers are trained to be cautious and methodical in their gathering of evidence or employment of their powers, so as not to have criminals be released due to legal loopholes or mistrials. Other than a name change, Sector Rangers changed little during the time of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"},". Sector Rangers had the right to commandeer local policemen or make use of Republic (or Imperial) vessels in the course of their duties, although most avoided doing so unless the situation at hand required such draconian methods.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Sector Ranger Encounters"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Sector Rangers are highly trained and competent individuals that are used to tackling difficult cases on their own. They are capable combatants, usually more than a match for the scum they track down and apprehend. On particularly dangerous cases, Sector Rangers often travel in pairs or groups of four, with their own ship and complement of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Considering the highly unusual circumstances that most Sector Rangers find themselves in, they could be in the company of almost any type of archetype- ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mercenaries"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mercenaries","referenceId":"reference:7db5f4a3b7fe5a00"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilots"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilots_(CL_5)"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Slicers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Slicers"},", or even ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gamblers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gamblers"},"- each possessing some unique skill that proves helpful to the Sector Ranger in bringing criminals to justice.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Sector Ranger Statistics (CL 7)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldier","referenceId":"reference:f826baa05bef6921"}," 4/",{"tag":"a","children":["Scout"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scout","referenceId":"reference:8a1db462be753774"}," 2/",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundr